if;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">$370.0 million remained available for repurchase.</span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> See Note 9-Stockholders&#8217; Equity </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">and Management&#8217;s Discussion and Analysis&#8212;Liquidity and Capital Resources&#8212;Share Repurchase Program</span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> for additional information about the Share Repurchase Program.</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div id="iff8bf9086abe47519d19f4b03203c982_187"></div><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Item 5. Other Information</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-5" name="ecd:NonRule10b51ArrTrmntdFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false" id="f-653"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-5" name="ecd:Rule10b51ArrTrmntdFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false" id="f-654"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-5" name="ecd:NonRule10b51ArrAdoptedFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false" id="f-655">Insider Trading Arrangements</ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-122" name="ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock" id="f-656" escape="true"><div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-122" name="ecd:TrdArrAdoptionDate" id="f-657">June 19, 2026</ix:nonNumeric>, <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-122" name="ecd:TrdArrIndName" id="f-658">Matthew J.